   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Arbetsskyddsprojekt i Estland fas 1. Kunskaps&#xF6;verf&#xF6;ring och tillg&#xE5;ng till svensk expertis inom maskinsystem, riskv&#xE4;rdering och kemikalie- hantering. Insatskomponenterna syftar till att st&#xE4;rka National Labour Inspectorate&apos;s f&#xF6;rm&#xE5;ga att implementera den harmoniserade lagstiftningen. Svensk part ASS. Totalt st&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r fas 1: SEK 1 669 395</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase one of occupational safety project in Estonia. Transfer of know-how and support from Swedish expertis in the field of machinery systems and handling of chemicals. Swedish counterpart is ASS (Swedish National Board of Occupational Safety). Sida&apos;s total contribution for the first phase amounts to a max.of 1 669 395 SEK</narrative>
